{"kind":"github_issue","repository":"Trae-AI/TRAE","item":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2416","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2416/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2416/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2416/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2416","id":4162380473,"node_id":"I_kwDONiYvnc74GOK5","number":2416,"title":"【改进建议】win11使用trae远程连接模块bug（WSL连接、SSH连接）","user":{"login":"sorrowdream00","id":5976285,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NzYyODU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5976285?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sorrowdream00","html_url":"https://github.com/sorrowdream00","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sorrowdream00/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sorrowdream00/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sorrowdream00/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sorrowdream00/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sorrowdream00/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sorrowdream00/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sorrowdream00/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sorrowdream00/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sorrowdream00/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-03-29T03:42:09Z","updated_at":"2026-04-11T16:36:40Z","closed_at":"2026-04-11T16:36:40Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"管理员好，希望能改进trae运行在Linux的工具：trae-server/trae的与trae建立连接ws网络参数，从localhost改为wsl或Linux主机的局域IP，谢谢！\n\n\n1、背景说明\n为了避免WSL的系统网络与Win11的网络使用同一个端口的冲突，比如为了测试openclaw在不同系统运行情况，分别在WSL和Win11安装，同时都使用默认端口18789，就会导致另外一个必须改端口。因此调整了wsl的网络模式：从Mirrored调整为NAT\n\n\n2、排查过程\nwsl的网络模式从“Mirrored”改为了“NAT“，这就导致了一个问题了：无法在通过trae打开wsl。远程连接从wsl连接切换为使用ssh连接，同样无法使用。经过使用“开发者工具”排查，发现问题出在一个关键的Websocket 无法建立链接，结合上下文分析出这个Websocket服务是在wsl上启动的，同时ws的连接地址写的环路地址（127.0.0.1或localhost），结合前面已经把wsl改为了NAT，推测，ws地址改为wsl的局域网地址应该就可以使用。\n\n\n报错“无法获取远程环境”和“无法连接到远程扩展主机服务器 (错误: WebSocket close with status code 1006)”\n<img width=\"2532\" height=\"1462\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3535cd0c-8645-49a7-a02e-3dc11217e8e9\" />\n\ndebug页面，ws一直无法建立链接：\n<img width=\"2502\" height=\"1366\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e68b9ef9-691c-430d-b327-2354a0e2f60b\" />\n\n3、以下方法均可使用\n经测试方法模式可以让trae使用（wslsetting位置：C:\\Program Files\\WSL\\wslsettings\\wslsettings.exe）。两种方法核心理念都是为配合ws网络为localhost，调整本机设置。\n\n方法1：wsl的网络设置为Mirrored，完全可以打开\n<img width=\"1844\" height=\"716\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d4af2671-1835-472e-a1e8-b3cb2a62c830\" />\n\n方法2：wsl的网络设置为Mirrored，但是需要启用localhost转发\n<img width=\"1834\" height=\"626\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bbc188e5-1040-4df2-80bd-33c95935e39e\" />","closed_by":{"login":"sorrowdream00","id":5976285,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NzYyODU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5976285?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sorrowdream00","html_url":"https://github.com/sorrowdream00","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sorrowdream00/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sorrowdream00/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sorrowdream00/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sorrowdream00/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sorrowdream00/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sorrowdream00/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sorrowdream00/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sorrowdream00/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sorrowdream00/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2416/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2416/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null},"comments":[]}